Jason: Phew!I thought for a minute that it was a clumsy burglar.

294
00:14:48,100 --> 00:14:50,700
迈克:波纳真的参加陆战队了.你能相信吗,爸爸?
Mike: I mean Boner actually joined the Marines.Can you believe that dad?

295
00:14:50,700 --> 00:14:51,500
杰森:喔
Jason: Well...

296
00:14:51,500 --> 00:14:54,200
迈克:是的,这个卑鄙小人两星期后要去参加军训了.
Mike: Yeah.That dweeb leaves for basic and training in two weeks.

297
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:56,100
杰森:为什么,你为什么要生气呢?
Jason: Why, what are you so angry about?

298
00:14:56,100 --> 00:14:59,400
迈克:你没听见我说的吗?他刚刚加入了陆战队.
Mike: Haven't you heard a word I said dad?He just joined the Marines.

299
00:14:59,960 --> 00:15:04,440
杰森:那也应该是陆战队感到不安啊?来,
Jason: Well shouldn't it be the Marines who are upset?Come on Mike.

300
00:15:04,460 --> 00:15:07,460
迈克.
I mean I understand you being upset about your best friend going away,

301
00:15:07,460 --> 00:15:08,500
我理解你这么难过是因为你最好的朋友要离开了,但是你所有的愤怒是从何而来呢?
but where is all this anger from?

302
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:11,160
迈克:因为,爸爸,
Mike: Because dad, he's making a big mistake.

303
00:15:11,980 --> 00:15:14,220
他犯了一个大错误.你应当听见他今晚所说的了.
I mean you should have heard him tonight.I was pathetic.

304
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:17,960
我很可怜,他不停地唠叨,关于这个决定,
He was babbling some nonsense about making a decision about what he wants

305
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:20,900
关于他想决定自己的命运.在未来选择他之前选择他的未来.
to do with his life.About picking his future before it picks him.

306
00:15:20,900 --> 00:15:25,000
杰森:说说可怜的地方,迈克.
Jason: Get to the pathetic part Mike.

307
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:27,700
麦琪:我听见吵闹声,你这个时候在做什么呢,迈克?
Maggie: I heard all the yelling.What did you do this time Mike?

308
00:15:27,700 --> 00:15:30,500
杰森:波纳真的入伍了.
Jason: Boner really enlisted.

309
00:15:30,500 --> 00:15:31,500
麦琪:真的?
Maggie: Really?

310
00:15:32,560 --> 00:15:34,760
迈克:是的,我想和他谈谈,但他不听我.
Mike: Yeah.I mean I tried to talk to him but he wouldn't listen to me.

311
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:39,000
我是说,像这种谈话,
I mean do you have any idea what its like to talk to somebody about their

312
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:40,600
关系到他的未来,他却一个字也不听,你们能有什么办法吗?
future, and have not a word of what you're saying sink in?

313
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:43,100
杰森:不不,不是我.麦琪你怎么样?
Jason: No.No.Not me.How about you Mags?

314
00:15:43,100 --> 00:15:45,600
麦琪:无能为力.
Maggie: Nah.

315
00:15:45,980 --> 00:15:48,980
杰森:迈克,
Jason: Mike, have you considered the possibility that Boner's decision

316
00:15:48,980 --> 00:15:49,900
你考虑过波纳的决定可能对他是一个好的选择吗?
is a good one for him?

317
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:52,940
迈克:哦,爸爸.
Mike: Oh come on dad.Boner's a quitter.He's a college drop out.

318
00:15:53,400 --> 00:15:53,800
波纳是个胆小鬼,他是大学的逃兵,你还要护着他?
And you defend him?

319
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:55,300
麦琪:迈克,你为什么如此生气?
Maggie: Mike, why are you so angry?

320
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:58,700
迈克:你们俩怎么了?呃?
Mike: What is with the two of you?Hu?I mean isn't it obvious?

321
00:15:58,920 --> 00:16:00,800
我的意思还不明显吗?波纳要离开我,
Boner is leaving me and he's happy about it.

322
00:16:00,800 --> 00:16:03,940
他倒很开心.
And now he's going off raving about how great it is to have found his

323
00:16:03,940 --> 00:16:04,100
他以为他找到了他愚蠢的将来,他以为他做得很了不起.
stupid future.

324
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:06,000
麦琪:找到自己的未来不是一件快事.
Maggie: Finding your future is not a bad thing.

325
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:08,400
迈克:哦,那么你也想让我加入陆战队吗?
Mike: Oh, so do you want me to go and join the Marines too?

326
00:16:08,400 --> 00:16:10,800
麦琪:不,但是考虑你的将来不会对你有坏处.
Maggie: No.But it wouldn't hurt you to think about your future.

327
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:14,200
迈克:你们好像认为波纳比我强.
Mike: You're acting like Boner's got the jump on me, or something.

328
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:15,100
杰森:你认为呢?
Jason: You think he does?

329
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:26,100
迈克:波纳!哦!白日做梦.
Mike: Boner!Hu!That will be the day.As you were.

330
00:16:26,100 --> 00:16:28,700
麦琪:波纳,陆战队
Maggie: Boner.Marine.

331
00:16:28,700 --> 00:16:30,900
杰森:这些小孩子什么时候长成大人了,麦琪?
Jason: When did these kids become adults Maggie?

332
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:32,400
麦琪:我不知道.
Maggie: I don't know.

333
00:16:33,340 --> 00:16:36,400
对于我来说,波纳总是那个一年级的小孩子,
To me Boner will always be that little kid in the first grade,

334
00:16:36,400 --> 00:16:38,100
忘记了穿裤子而哭哭啼啼.
crying because he forgot his pants.

335
00:16:38,100 --> 00:16:48,700
杰森:是的,很快他就会保护我们的国家.上帝保佑美国.
Jason: Yeah.Soon he'll be defending our country.God bless America.

336
00:16:48,700 --> 00:16:51,100
杰森:今晚早上在哪个车站送你们?
Jason: So, where's the station sending you this morning?

337
00:16:51,100 --> 00:16:54,800
麦琪:我不知道,分配的人说会是个惊喜.
Maggie: I don't know.The assignment desk said it was a surprise.

338
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:56,000
开萝尔:你听起来不开心.
Carol: You don't sound happy.

339
00:16:56,000 --> 00:17:00,200
麦琪:惊喜通常指一些奇怪的事.
Maggie: Well usually a surprise means something strange.

340
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:03,200
波纳:惊喜!
Boner: Surprise!

341
00:17:03,200 --> 00:17:04,400
杰森:早上好!
Jason: Morning!

342
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:06,400
麦琪:看你.
Maggie: Look at you.

343
00:17:06,540 --> 00:17:10,120
波纳:好的,军装很适合我,那是我爸爸的制服.
Boner: Yeah.Greens my color, aint it?It's my dad's uniform.

344
00:17:10,220 --> 00:17:10,800
看,名字相同,所有都相同.
See, same name and everything.

345
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:11,600
杰森:太令人惊讶了.
Jason: Amazing.

346
00:17:12,700 --> 00:17:15,120
波纳:是的.今天是我要去参加军训的日子,
Boner: Yeah.Well today's the day I leave for basic.

347
00:17:15,360 --> 00:17:17,600
我爸爸在外面的车里,
My days out in the car waiting to take me to the airport and I just

348
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:21,960
等着送我去机场,我只是想在走之前打声招呼.
wanted to stop by before I left to say hey.Hey.

349
00:17:23,300 --> 00:17:24,900
杰森:哦,你想的真是非常周到,波纳.
Jason: Oh that's very thoughtful of you Boner.

350
00:17:24,900 --> 00:17:27,400
波纳:是的,你和西维尔太太就像是我的第二个父母.
Boner: Yeah, well you and Mrs.Seaver have been like second parents to me.

351
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:29,200
麦琪:哦,波纳,你嘴真甜.
Maggie: Oh Boner, that's so sweet.

352
00:17:30,940 --> 00:17:33,000
波纳:还有你本,你就像我的第二个弟弟,
Boner: And you Bennie.You've been like a second brother to me.

353
00:17:33,140 --> 00:17:34,720
尽管我并没有第一个.
Except I never had a first brother.

354
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:37,000
本:我想我要说声谢谢你.
Ben: Thanks I guess.

355
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:40,900
波纳:还有开萝尔,不要为这哭泣.
Boner: And Carol, well, why cry over what may have been.

356
00:17:40,900 --> 00:17:42,000
开萝尔:什么?
Carol: What?

357
00:17:42,380 --> 00:17:43,840
波纳:我知道我们相处得很棒,但是我相信你还会找到其他人的,
Boner: I know we would have been great together,

358
00:17:43,840 --> 00:17:48,500
会有那一天.
but I'm sure you'll find somebody else.Someday.

359
00:17:50,300 --> 00:17:56,900
开萝尔:谢谢你,我希望如此.
Carol: Thank you.I sure hope so.

360
00:17:56,900 --> 00:18:00,700
波纳:所以,不管怎样.
Boner: So, anyway.

361
00:18:00,700 --> 00:18:02,900
杰森:好的,你已经对迈克说再见了吗?
Jason: Yeah, have you already been up to say goodbye to Mike?

362
00:18:02,900 --> 00:18:06,400
波纳:哦,不.我和迈克再也不说话了,我们发生了争吵.
Boner: Uh no.Me and Mike aint talking.We had a fight.

363
00:18:07,080 --> 00:18:10,020
麦琪:哦,波纳,
Maggie: Oh Boner, if people stop talking to people they care about just

364
00:18:10,020 --> 00:18:10,800
如果人们因为一场争吵就不再说话的话……
because of a fight...

365
00:18:10,800 --> 00:18:13,700
本:屋子就更安静了.
Ben: This house would be a lot quieter.

366
00:18:13,700 --> 00:18:15,700
麦琪:那倒是真的.
Maggie: That's true.

367
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:18,260
波纳:是的,我不想见迈克,
Boner: Yeah well, well, I don't want to see Mike.

368
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:21,560
我甚至不想和他说话.他在家吗?
I don't even want to talk to him.Is he home?

369
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:25,300
杰森:是的,他应该在.他可能睡着了.
Jason: Yeah he should be.He's probably asleep.

370
00:18:25,300 --> 00:18:26,400
波纳:你怎么知道?
Boner: How do you now?

371
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:28,900
杰森:他十五分钟以后有堂课.
Jason: He's got a class in fifteen minutes.

372
00:18:28,900 --> 00:18:35,400
迈克:钥匙呢.好的,波纳.
Mike: Keys.Alright.Boner.

373
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:36,500
波纳:迈克.
Boner: Mikey.

374
00:18:36,500 --> 00:18:39,000
波纳:你要去上课吗?
Boner: So, are you on your way to class?

375
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:40,000
迈克:今天星期几?
Mike: What day is it today?

376
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:41,200
波纳:星期三.
Boner: Wednesday.

377
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,500
迈克:你说的对,我有课.
Mike: Oh, you're right.I do have a class.

378
00:18:43,900 --> 00:18:45,580
波纳:我不想打扰你,我只是想说声再见,
Boner: I didn't want to bother you.I just want to say goodbye.

379
00:18:45,940 --> 00:18:46,400
我今天要走了.
I'm leaving today.

380
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:49,200
迈克:好的,我知道.我正要去你家.
Mike: Yeah, I know.I was going to come by your house.

381
00:18:49,200 --> 00:18:50,800
波纳:真的?
Boner: Yeah?

382
00:18:51,480 --> 00:18:54,300
迈克:真的,我不能让我的好伙伴就这么走,
Mike: Yeah.I mean, hey.

383
00:18:54,300 --> 00:18:58,400
一句招呼也不打.
I couldn't let my buddy leave without at least saying hey.Hey.

384
00:18:58,400 --> 00:19:00,100
波纳:嘿.
Boner: Hey.

385
00:19:00,100 --> 00:19:04,100
迈克:嘿,我以为你到了军营才会有衣服发.
Mike: Hey, you know I didn't think you'd get that suit till after boot camp.

386
00:19:04,100 --> 00:19:06,100
波纳:哦,这是我爸爸的,他在塔姆得到的.
Boner: Oh, this is my dads.He got it in tam.

387
00:19:06,100 --> 00:19:07,300
迈克:你不是指偷吧?
Mike: Don't you mean Nam?

388
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:12,720
波纳:不不,塔姆就是塔姆波特.
Boner: No, no, no.Tam as in Tampot.That's where he was stationed.

389
00:19:13,540 --> 00:19:14,000
那是他服役的地方,那是他最喜欢的玩笑.
That's his favorite joke.

390
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:15,100
迈克:很有趣.
Mike: It's a good one.

391
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:18,060
波纳:好的,现在我想让其他陆战队员知道士兵理查德?
Boner: Yeah.Now I want to show the other Marines that Private Richard

392
00:19:18,580 --> 00:19:21,500
波纳已经准备好了.你知道座右铭"时刻准备着",很高兴看见你,
Stabone is ready.You know the motto "Be prepared".

393
00:19:25,520 --> 00:19:27,980
不再争吵了,迈克.
You know it's nice to see you and not be arguing Mike.

394
00:19:29,120 --> 00:19:34,320
迈克:是的,是的,
Mike: Yeah.Yeah you know, I've been thinking Bone and you know,

395
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:35,600
我一直在想,波纳,如果你很严肃地对待这件愚蠢的事
if you are really this serious about this dumb thing...

396
00:19:35,600 --> 00:19:37,000
波纳:那不是一件愚蠢的事.
Boner: It's not a dumb thing.

397
00:19:37,620 --> 00:19:39,560
迈克:嘿,听着,
Mike: Hey.Look, let's not go through that again.

398
00:19:41,980 --> 00:19:43,800
我们别再争吵了.你是我的朋友,我想对你说再见.
You're my friend and I want to ay goodbye.

399
00:19:43,800 --> 00:19:46,900
波纳:好的,再见.
Boner: Fine.Goodbye.

400
00:19:46,900 --> 00:19:49,500
迈克:波纳,我很难过.
Mike: Look Boner.I'm sorry.

401
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:59,100
波纳:我也是,迈克.我想我们后会有期.
Boner: Me too Mikey.Well, I guess I'll see you later.

402
00:19:59,100 --> 00:20:08,400
迈克:是的,后会有期.
Mike: Yeah.I'll see you later.

403
00:20:08,400 --> 00:20:17,300
波纳:那是我的爸爸,我走了.
Boner: It's my dad.Got to go.

404
00:20:17,700 --> 00:20:21,160
迈克:嘿,我送你下楼.
Mike: Hey, well I'll, I'll walk you down the stairs.

405
00:20:22,220 --> 00:20:23,700
上两个星期你做了什么?
So what've you been doing the last couple of weeks?

406
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:25,280
波纳:我一直在准备,
Boner: Well I've been getting ready,

407
00:20:25,360 --> 00:20:26,900
每天起床跑六英里.
you know working out and running those six miles everyday.

408
00:20:26,900 --> 00:20:27,800
迈克:哦.
Mike: Yeah.

409
00:20:27,800 --> 00:20:31,000
波纳:问题是我太累了,总是得乘车回来.
Boner: Thing is I get so tired, I usually need a ride back.

410
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:36,500
迈克:你为什么不只跑三英里呢,然后……很棒,跑步很棒.
Mike: Why don't you just run three miles one way and then...well good.Running's good.

411
00:20:36,500 --> 00:20:39,600
波纳:整件事情我感觉非常好.
Boner: I feel so great about this whole thing.

412
00:20:39,600 --> 00:20:40,800
迈克:是的,你不紧张了?
Mike: Yeah.You're not nervous?

413
00:20:40,800 --> 00:20:43,560
波纳:我人生中第一次感觉到明天就要不同了,更好,最好.我再也不是那个波纳了.我要成为士兵理查德?波纳.
Boner: No.For the first time in my whole life I feel that tomorrow is

414
00:20:43,680 --> 00:20:47,440
going to be different.Better.The best.I'm not going to just be Boner anymore

415
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:48,900
I'm going to be Private Richard Stabone

416
00:20:51,100 --> 00:20:55,100
迈克:是的,波纳,我认为你做得对.
Mike: Yeah well, you know Boner, I think you are doing the right thing.

417
00:20:55,100 --> 00:20:58,300
波纳:谢谢,迈克,我也是.
Boner: Thanks Mikey.Me too.

418
00:20:58,300 --> 00:20:59,100
迈克:嘿,你会写信给我吗?
Mike: Hey, you're going to write me?

419
00:20:59,100 --> 00:21:03,300
波纳:哦,当然,你住在哪?
Boner: Oh sure.Where do you live?

420
00:21:03,300 --> 00:21:04,100
迈克:就是这儿.
Mike: Right here.

421
00:21:04,100 --> 00:21:06,000
波纳:不,我是说你的地址.
Boner: No, I mean your address.

422
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:07,500
迈克:罗宾汉街15号,你知道的.
Mike: Fifteen Robinhood Lane.You know that.

423
00:21:07,500 --> 00:21:10,800
波纳:嘿,这可是十三年没写信给你了.
Boner: Hey, it's been thirteen years and I never had to write you.

424
00:21:10,800 --> 00:21:16,000
迈克:是的,你可以直接上门.
Mike: Yeah.You could just come by.

425
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:18,700
波纳:军训要两个月,结束后我会有三天的休假.
Boner: Well basics is over in two months, and then I get a three day furlough.

426
00:21:18,700 --> 00:21:19,700
迈克:太好了,我都等不及了.
Mike: Alright, I can't wait.

427
00:21:20,120 --> 00:21:21,460
波纳:好的,我们可以保持友谊,
Boner: Yeah, we can hang out and goof around.

428
00:21:21,660 --> 00:21:22,500
把时间花在你身上,我很开心.
I'll be happy to waste time with you then.

429
00:21:22,500 --> 00:21:22,800
迈克:哦.
Mike: Ah yeah.

430
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:23,600
波纳:像以前那样.
Boner: Like the good old days.

431
00:21:23,600 --> 00:21:24,400
迈克:你发誓.
Mike: You bet ya.

432
00:21:24,400 --> 00:21:26,700
波纳:好的,棍子也不可能打折我们的友谊.
Boner: Yeah, you can't kill a friendship like ours with a stick.

433
00:21:26,700 --> 00:21:27,900
迈克:即使是一根大棍子也不能.
Mike: Not even with a big stick.

434
00:21:27,900 --> 00:21:36,400
波纳:不能.
Boner: No.

435
00:21:36,400 --> 00:21:37,700
迈克:我们后会有期.
Mike: Well I guess I'll see you later.

436
00:21:37,700 --> 00:21:42,600
波纳:是的,后会有期.我要送你到台阶.
Boner: Yeah.See you later.I'll walk you back to your steps.

437
00:21:42,600 --> 00:21:44,200
迈克:好的,太好了.
Mike: Alright.Great.

438
00:21:44,200 --> 00:21:59,400
波纳:是的.后会有期.
Boner: Yeah.So.See you later.

439
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:06,900
